---
import '../../styles/admin-commerce.css';
---
<section id="view-commerce-dashboard" class="admin-section commerce-admin" style="display:none;" aria-labelledby="commerce-dashboard-title">
  <a class="commerce-back-link" href="/admin/commerce" data-view-target="commerce"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Commerce</a>
  <div class="commerce-command"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Operación comercial</p><h2 id="commerce-dashboard-title">Dashboard de ventas</h2><p>Ingresos, ganancia bruta, pedidos e inventario calculados desde datos reales.</p></div><label class="commerce-period"><span>Periodo</span><select id="commerce-dashboard-period"><option value="today">Hoy</option><option value="7d">7 días</option><option value="30d" selected>30 días</option><option value="year">Este año</option></select></label></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel commerce-top-products"><div class="commerce-panel-head"><div><h3>Productos más vendidos</h3><p>Unidades confirmadas en el periodo; sin estimaciones.</p></div><div><span>Ticket promedio</span><strong id="market-average-ticket">—</strong></div></div><div class="market-recent-list" id="commerce-top-products"><p class="commerce-table-state">Cargando productos…</p></div></div>
  <div class="commerce-metrics commerce-metrics-six"><article><span>Ventas</span><strong id="market-sales">—</strong><small>Pagadas y completadas</small></article><article><span>Ganancia bruta</span><strong id="market-profit">—</strong><small>Según costo snapshot</small></article><article><span>Pedidos</span><strong id="market-orders">—</strong><small>En el periodo</small></article><article><span>Por verificar</span><strong id="market-review">—</strong><small>Pagos en revisión</small></article><article><span>Disponibles</span><strong id="market-available">—</strong><small>Publicaciones activas</small></article><article><span>Stock bajo</span><strong id="market-low">—</strong><small>Umbral configurado</small></article></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel"><div class="commerce-panel-head"><div><h3>Ingresos confirmados</h3><p>Serie diaria del periodo seleccionado.</p></div></div><div class="commerce-chart" id="commerce-chart" role="img" aria-label="Gráfica de ingresos"></div></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel"><div class="commerce-panel-head"><div><h3>Actividad reciente</h3><p>Últimos pedidos registrados.</p></div></div><div class="market-recent-list" id="commerce-recent-activity"><p class="commerce-table-state">Cargando actividad…</p></div></div>
</section>

<section id="view-commerce-orders" class="admin-section commerce-admin" style="display:none;" aria-labelledby="commerce-orders-title">
  <a class="commerce-back-link" href="/admin/commerce" data-view-target="commerce"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Commerce</a>
  <div class="commerce-command"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Venta y seguimiento</p><h2 id="commerce-orders-title">Pedidos</h2><p>Revisa pagos, snapshots, timeline y cambia únicamente a estados válidos.</p></div><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-secondary" id="orders-refresh" type="button">Actualizar</button></div>
  <div class="commerce-metrics"><article><span>Pendientes</span><strong id="orders-pending">—</strong></article><article><span>Revisión</span><strong id="orders-review">—</strong></article><article><span>Pagados</span><strong id="orders-paid">—</strong></article><article><span>Preparando / listos</span><strong id="orders-ready">—</strong></article></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel"><form class="commerce-filters" id="orders-filters"><label class="commerce-search"><span>Buscar</span><input name="q" type="search" placeholder="Folio, cliente, correo o teléfono" /></label><label><span>Estado</span><select name="status"><option value="">Todos</option><option>PENDING_PAYMENT</option><option>PAYMENT_REVIEW</option><option>PAID</option><option>PREPARING</option><option>READY</option><option>COMPLETED</option><option>CANCELLED</option></select></label><label><span>Desde</span><input name="from" type="date" /></label><label><span>Hasta</span><input name="to" type="date" /></label><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-primary" type="submit">Aplicar</button></form><div class="commerce-table-wrap"><table class="commerce-table"><thead><tr><th>Folio</th><th>Cliente</th><th>Items</th><th>Total</th><th>Pago</th><th>Estado</th><th>Fecha</th></tr></thead><tbody id="orders-body"><tr><td colspan="7" class="commerce-table-state">Cargando pedidos…</td></tr></tbody></table></div><nav class="commerce-pagination" id="orders-pagination"><button id="orders-prev" type="button">Anterior</button><span id="orders-page">Página 1</span><button id="orders-next" type="button">Siguiente</button></nav></div>
</section>

<section id="view-commerce-payments" class="admin-section commerce-admin" style="display:none;" aria-labelledby="commerce-payments-title">
  <a class="commerce-back-link" href="/admin/commerce" data-view-target="commerce"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Commerce</a>
  <div class="commerce-command"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Control de cobros</p><h2 id="commerce-payments-title">Pagos</h2><p>Abre el pedido para revisar el comprobante, aprobarlo o solicitar otro.</p></div></div>
  <div class="commerce-resource-tabs" id="payment-tabs"><button class="is-active" data-payment-status="" type="button">Todos</button><button data-payment-status="PENDING" type="button">Pendientes</button><button data-payment-status="UNDER_REVIEW" type="button">En revisión</button><button data-payment-status="APPROVED" type="button">Confirmados</button><button data-payment-status="REJECTED" type="button">Rechazados</button></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel"><div class="commerce-table-wrap"><table class="commerce-table"><thead><tr><th>Pedido</th><th>Cliente</th><th>Método</th><th>Monto</th><th>Estado</th><th>Revisó</th><th>Fecha revisión</th></tr></thead><tbody id="payments-body"><tr><td colspan="7" class="commerce-table-state">Cargando pagos…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section id="view-commerce-inventory" class="admin-section commerce-admin" style="display:none;" aria-labelledby="commerce-inventory-title">
  <a class="commerce-back-link" href="/admin/commerce" data-view-target="commerce"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Commerce</a>
  <div class="commerce-command"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Trazabilidad</p><h2 id="commerce-inventory-title">Inventario</h2><p>Cada reserva, venta, liberación, devolución y ajuste queda registrado.</p></div><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-primary" id="inventory-adjust-open" type="button">Nuevo ajuste</button></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel commerce-inventory-current"><div class="commerce-panel-head"><div><h3>Existencias actuales</h3><p>La disponibilidad se calcula como stock menos reservas activas.</p></div></div><div class="commerce-table-wrap"><table class="commerce-table"><thead><tr><th>SKU / producto</th><th>Categoría</th><th>Actual</th><th>Reservado</th><th>Disponible</th><th>Mínimo</th><th>Valor</th><th>Ubicación</th></tr></thead><tbody id="inventory-items-body"><tr><td colspan="8" class="commerce-table-state">Cargando existencias…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
  <div class="commerce-metrics"><article><span>Stock</span><strong id="inventory-stock">—</strong></article><article><span>Valor</span><strong id="inventory-value">—</strong></article><article><span>Equipos disponibles</span><strong id="inventory-available">—</strong></article><article><span>Reservados</span><strong id="inventory-reserved">—</strong></article><article><span>Bajo stock</span><strong id="inventory-low">—</strong></article></div>
  <div class="commerce-resource-tabs" id="inventory-tabs"><button class="is-active" data-inventory-reason="" type="button">Todos</button><button data-inventory-reason="RESERVE" type="button">Reservas</button><button data-inventory-reason="SALE" type="button">Ventas</button><button data-inventory-reason="RELEASE" type="button">Liberaciones</button><button data-inventory-reason="ADJUSTMENT" type="button">Ajustes</button><button data-inventory-reason="RETURN" type="button">Devoluciones</button></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel"><div class="commerce-table-wrap"><table class="commerce-table"><thead><tr><th>Artículo</th><th>Anterior</th><th>Movimiento</th><th>Nuevo</th><th>Razón</th><th>Referencia</th><th>Usuario</th><th>Fecha</th></tr></thead><tbody id="inventory-body"><tr><td colspan="8" class="commerce-table-state">Cargando movimientos…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section id="view-commerce-promotions" class="admin-section commerce-admin" style="display:none;" aria-labelledby="commerce-promotions-title">
  <a class="commerce-back-link" href="/admin/commerce" data-view-target="commerce"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Commerce</a>
  <div class="commerce-command"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Precio y presentación</p><h2 id="commerce-promotions-title">Promociones</h2><p>Descuentos por artículo o categoría con fechas reales.</p></div><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-primary" id="promotion-create" type="button">Crear promoción</button></div>
  <div class="commerce-resource-tabs" id="promotion-tabs"><button class="is-active" data-promotion-status="" type="button">Todas</button><button data-promotion-status="ACTIVE" type="button">Activas</button><button data-promotion-status="SCHEDULED" type="button">Programadas</button><button data-promotion-status="ENDED" type="button">Finalizadas</button></div>
  <div class="commerce-panel"><div class="commerce-table-wrap"><table class="commerce-table"><thead><tr><th>Promoción</th><th>Tipo</th><th>Valor</th><th>Scope</th><th>Vigencia</th><th>Estado</th></tr></thead><tbody id="promotions-body"><tr><td colspan="6" class="commerce-table-state">Cargando promociones…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section id="view-commerce-settings" class="admin-section commerce-admin" style="display:none;" aria-labelledby="commerce-settings-payment-title">
  <a class="commerce-back-link" href="/admin/commerce" data-view-target="commerce"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Commerce</a>
  <div class="commerce-command"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Configuración → Ventas</p><h2 id="commerce-settings-payment-title">Métodos de pago</h2><p>Los datos guardados aquí son los únicos que verá el cliente y recibirá por correo.</p></div></div>
  <form class="commerce-panel payment-settings-form" id="payment-settings-form">
    <fieldset><legend>Transferencia bancaria</legend><label class="commerce-switch"><input name="BANK_TRANSFER.enabled" type="checkbox" /> Activa</label><div class="commerce-form-grid"><label><span>Beneficiario</span><input name="BANK_TRANSFER.beneficiary" maxlength="160" /></label><label><span>Banco</span><input name="BANK_TRANSFER.bank" maxlength="120" /></label><label><span>Cuenta</span><input name="BANK_TRANSFER.account" maxlength="40" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label><span>CLABE</span><input name="BANK_TRANSFER.clabe" maxlength="24" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label><span>Tarjeta opcional</span><input name="BANK_TRANSFER.card" maxlength="24" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label class="commerce-span-2"><span>Instrucciones</span><textarea name="BANK_TRANSFER.instructions" rows="3" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label></div></fieldset>
    <fieldset><legend>Pago al recoger</legend><label class="commerce-switch"><input name="CASH.enabled" type="checkbox" /> Efectivo activo</label><label><span>Instrucciones</span><textarea name="CASH.instructions" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><label class="commerce-switch"><input name="TERMINAL.enabled" type="checkbox" /> Terminal activa</label><label><span>Instrucciones</span><textarea name="TERMINAL.instructions" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label></fieldset>
    <fieldset><legend>Proveedores externos</legend><p class="commerce-field-help">Las credenciales y secretos de webhook se configuran únicamente mediante variables de entorno. Nunca se muestran aquí.</p><label class="commerce-switch"><input name="STRIPE.enabled" type="checkbox" /> Stripe <small data-provider-status="STRIPE">Comprobando configuración…</small></label><label><span>Instrucciones</span><textarea name="STRIPE.instructions" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><label class="commerce-switch"><input name="PAYPAL.enabled" type="checkbox" /> PayPal <small data-provider-status="PAYPAL">Comprobando configuración…</small></label><label><span>Instrucciones</span><textarea name="PAYPAL.instructions" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><label class="commerce-switch"><input name="MERCADO_PAGO.enabled" type="checkbox" /> Mercado Pago <small data-provider-status="MERCADO_PAGO">Comprobando configuración…</small></label><label><span>Instrucciones</span><textarea name="MERCADO_PAGO.instructions" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label></fieldset>
    <aside class="payment-settings-preview"><span>Vista cliente</span><h3 id="payment-preview-title">Realiza tu transferencia</h3><div id="payment-settings-preview"></div></aside>
    <div class="commerce-form-message" id="payment-settings-message" hidden></div><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-primary" type="submit">Guardar métodos</button>
  </form>
</section>

<div class="commerce-modal" id="order-detail-modal" hidden><div class="commerce-modal-backdrop" data-market-close="order"></div><section class="commerce-modal-card commerce-modal-card-wide" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="order-detail-title"><header class="commerce-modal-head"><div><p class="commerce-kicker">Pedido</p><h2 id="order-detail-title">Detalle</h2></div><button class="commerce-icon-button" type="button" data-market-close="order" aria-label="Cerrar">×</button></header><div id="order-detail-content"></div></section></div>

<div class="commerce-modal" id="inventory-adjust-modal" hidden><div class="commerce-modal-backdrop" data-market-close="adjust"></div><section class="commerce-modal-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="inventory-adjust-title"><header class="commerce-modal-head"><h2 id="inventory-adjust-title">Ajustar inventario</h2><button class="commerce-icon-button" type="button" data-market-close="adjust">×</button></header><form id="inventory-adjust-form" class="commerce-form-grid"><label><span>ID de artículo</span><input name="catalog_item_id" type="number" min="1" required /></label><label><span>Delta</span><input name="delta" type="number" required /></label><label class="commerce-span-2"><span>Motivo obligatorio</span><textarea name="reason" maxlength="500" required></textarea></label><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-primary" type="submit">Registrar ajuste</button></form></section></div>

<div class="commerce-modal" id="promotion-modal" hidden><div class="commerce-modal-backdrop" data-market-close="promotion"></div><section class="commerce-modal-card commerce-modal-card-wide" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="promotion-modal-title"><header class="commerce-modal-head"><h2 id="promotion-modal-title">Crear promoción</h2><button class="commerce-icon-button" type="button" data-market-close="promotion">×</button></header><form id="promotion-form" class="commerce-form-grid"><input name="id" type="hidden" /><label class="commerce-span-2"><span>Nombre</span><input name="name" maxlength="160" required /></label><label><span>Tipo</span><select name="promotion_type"><option>PERCENT</option><option>FIXED</option><option>SALE_PRICE</option><option>BUNDLE_PRICE</option></select></label><label><span>Valor</span><input name="promotion_value" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" required /></label><label><span>Alcance</span><select name="scope"><option>ITEM</option><option>CATEGORY</option></select></label><label><span>Estado</span><select name="status"><option>DRAFT</option><option>ACTIVE</option><option>SCHEDULED</option><option>ENDED</option></select></label><label><span>Inicia</span><input name="starts_at" type="datetime-local" /></label><label><span>Termina</span><input name="ends_at" type="datetime-local" /></label><label class="commerce-span-2"><span>IDs objetivo separados por coma</span><input name="targets" placeholder="12, 18, 24" /></label><label class="commerce-span-2"><span>Título público</span><input name="presentation_title" maxlength="180" /></label><label class="commerce-span-2"><span>Texto público</span><textarea name="presentation_text" maxlength="500"></textarea></label><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-primary" type="submit">Guardar promoción</button></form></section></div>

<div class="commerce-modal" id="market-confirm-modal" hidden><div class="commerce-modal-backdrop"></div><section class="commerce-modal-card commerce-confirm-card" role="alertdialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="market-confirm-title" aria-describedby="market-confirm-text"><header class="commerce-modal-head"><h2 id="market-confirm-title">Confirmar operación</h2></header><p id="market-confirm-text"></p><div class="commerce-modal-actions"><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-secondary" id="market-confirm-cancel" type="button">Cancelar</button><button class="commerce-button commerce-button-primary" id="market-confirm-accept" type="button">Confirmar</button></div></section></div>
